WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.838 --> 00:00:16.829
Detective Smith was at his nephew's birthday party.

2
00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.674
A man was performing.

3
00:00:18.675 --> 00:00:21.758
"My name is Chuck," the man said.

4
00:00:21.759 --> 00:00:24.110
He moved a large doll on his lap.

5
00:00:24.111 --> 00:00:27.391
"And this is Chuckles. Say hello, Chuckles."

6
00:00:27.392 --> 00:00:29.235
"Hello, Chuckles."

7
00:00:29.236 --> 00:00:32.039
Chuck tried to pretend that Chuckles was talking.

8
00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:35.401
"Your mouth is moving!" a girl said.

9
00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:38.410
"This show stinks," a boy said.

10
00:00:38.411 --> 00:00:42.042
Chuck kept talking. "You're not good at this, Chuck.

11
00:00:42.043 --> 00:00:44.490
That's not nice, Chuckles.

12
00:00:44.491 --> 00:00:50.197
No, I'm not nice, Chuck. I'm bad, bad, bad!"

13
00:00:50.198 --> 00:00:56.098
Detective Smith groaned. "This is terrible."

14
00:00:56.099 --> 00:01:00.129
"I don't know what to get for Dina," Mara said.

15
00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:02.926
Roxy and her friends were at Downtown Toys.

16
00:01:02.927 --> 00:01:05.554
It was the biggest toy store in Metro City.

17
00:01:05.555 --> 00:01:07.727
Mara needed a gift for her cousin.

18
00:01:07.728 --> 00:01:10.374
"How old is Dina?" Roxy asked.

19
00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:14.138
"She's two years old," Mara said.

20
00:01:14.139 --> 00:01:16.537
"Hmm," Terrell said.

21
00:01:16.538 --> 00:01:19.207
"I wonder what two-year-olds like to do."

22
00:01:19.208 --> 00:01:22.930
Jack grabbed a plastic sword. "Does Dina like swords?"

23
00:01:22.931 --> 00:01:24.894
Jack swung the sword around.

24
00:01:24.895 --> 00:01:26.856
Then he pretended to fight Terrell.

25
00:01:26.857 --> 00:01:29.169
Terrell laughed and grabbed a sword.

26
00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:33.212
Bonk! Bang! He and Jack knocked the swords together.

27
00:01:33.213 --> 00:01:35.834
Roxy and Mara rolled their eyes.

28
00:01:35.835 --> 00:01:38.856
"Dina is lots of fun," Mara said.

29
00:01:38.857 --> 00:01:40.830
"I love playing with her.

30
00:01:40.831 --> 00:01:44.489
But I don't know what she does when I'm not around."

31
00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:47.609
"You can get her an art kit," Roxy said.

32
00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:52.569
She picked one up. "This has pencils, brushes, and paint."

33
00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:56.167
Mara shook her head. "That's too messy.

34
00:01:56.168 --> 00:02:01.792
The last time Dina came over, she smeared ketchup all over the table.

35
00:02:01.793 --> 00:02:06.624
I don't think she should have paint."

36
00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:10.444
"This store sells musical instruments," Roxy said.

37
00:02:10.445 --> 00:02:14.250
"You could get Dina a recorder or some drums."

38
00:02:14.251 --> 00:02:20.210
Mara snorted. "No way! Dina is loud enough already!"

39
00:02:20.211 --> 00:02:23.572
"Oof!" Terrell fell backward into Roxy.

40
00:02:23.573 --> 00:02:28.211
"Sorry!" Terrell said. "Jack knocked me over."

41
00:02:28.212 --> 00:02:32.807
Jack swung his sword. Terrell blocked it.

42
00:02:32.808 --> 00:02:38.447
Roxy laughed. "It's too bad Rocket Girl isn't here, Terrell."

43
00:02:38.448 --> 00:02:40.434
"Why?" Terrell asked.

44
00:02:40.435 --> 00:02:44.537
Roxy smiled. "She could help you defeat Jack!"

45
00:02:44.538 --> 00:02:46.892
"No way!" Jack said.

46
00:02:46.893 --> 00:02:49.158
"Even Rocket Girl can't defeat me.

47
00:02:49.159 --> 00:02:52.562
I'm Sir Jack, the bravest knight in the land!"

48
00:02:52.563 --> 00:02:55.898
"Ha!" Terrell leaped toward Jack with his sword.

49
00:02:55.899 --> 00:03:00.843
Roxy grabbed a sword, but then her watch beeped.

50
00:03:00.844 --> 00:03:07.113
She stepped away from her friends.

51
00:03:07.114 --> 00:03:11.006
"Mayor Bloom?" Roxy said. "What's wrong?"

52
00:03:11.007 --> 00:03:13.441
"Rocket Girl," Mayor Bloom said.

53
00:03:13.442 --> 00:03:16.878
"I need you to go to Metro City Convention Center.

54
00:03:16.879 --> 00:03:19.347
There's a huge doll show this weekend.

55
00:03:19.348 --> 00:03:23.189
Someone stole some very valuable dolls."

56
00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:25.431
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

57
00:03:25.432 --> 00:03:29.809
"Rocket Girl is on her way!"
